{"schema_version":"1","type":"concept","ts":"2026-08-11","feature":"core-tracking-selection-engine","session":"000-legacy-import","commit":"24ad1770a428a8019cd3ac10140ab70d0813d453","name":"Dynamic Dependency Tracking","problem":"Statically mapping which tests exercise which production code is unreliable and goes stale as code changes","how":"A java.lang.instrument agent records per-test class loads at runtime, attributing each loaded class to the test window (and container lifecycle) that caused it","realized_by":"blastradius-core/.../tracking/DependencyTrackingAgent.java\nblastradius-core/.../tracking/TestBoundaryListener.java","tags":"tracking\ncore\nruntime"}
